          "type": "text",
          "heading": "About the Event",
          "body": "We are pleased to share the successful implementation of a local event under the Visegrad Project ID: 22510078, coordinated by Mission: Reconnect, z.s. & Creative Youth Academy in Budapest, Hungary, on the 26th of January 2026."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "heading": "What We Did",
          "body": "As part of our ongoing efforts to foster sustainable communities, a dedicated workshop was organized to enhance environmental and ecological awareness among young people. The session focused on building knowledge, encouraging dialogue, and inspiring participants to take an active role in addressing environmental challenges.\n\nThrough interactive discussions and practical insights, participants were empowered to engage in community-driven initiatives, particularly in the area of community gardening as a tool for sustainability, cooperation, and local resilience."
        },
